.TH VIBEOS-FILES 1 "2026-11-16" "vibeos 0.1.0" "VibeOS"
.SH NAME
vibeos-files \- file manager for VibeOS
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vibeos-files
.RI [ URI ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
File Manager+ rebuilt in GTK 4 on GIO and GVfs: the phone's storage, removable media, the recycle bin, recent files,
the local network and saved remotes over SMB, SFTP, FTP/FTPS and WebDAV. A folder's URI browses that folder; a
file's URI browses the folder it is in. It is D-Bus activatable as vibeos.Files.
.SH SEE ALSO
gio(1)
